-   **How it Works:** WAIS clients queried WAIS servers that maintained searchable indexes of documents. The protocol used the Z39.50 standard for information retrieval. Users could specify relevance feedback to improve search results.
-   **Key Features:**
    -   **Full-Text Search:** Searched within documents.
